  "notes": "{信条|しんじょう} is composed of {信|しん} (belief) + {条|じょう} (article, clause).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜を{信条|しんじょう}とする: to make ~ one's creed\n- {信条|しんじょう}を{貫|つらぬ}く: to stick to one's beliefs\n- {信条|しんじょう}を{持|も}つ: to hold a belief\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {信条|しんじょう}: creed, personal principle (personal convictions)\n- {信念|しんねん}: conviction, belief (stronger, unwavering)\n- {主義|しゅぎ}: principle, -ism (ideological)",
